# The pop-ups of フォント設定 (design 10.6, 11.6), for tools/ui_run.py. The
# window of システム環境設定 is at 160,80: the tab 書体 at 278,125, Noto Serif JP
# on the list's third line at 300,194, 詳細情報 at 700,516. フォント設定 is at
# 200,110, its panel's parts 206 right and 138 down of where the panel puts
# them: 個別定義 at 500,163, ファミリ at 400,433. A list opens with the row of
# the name chosen over the part, a row 20 high; the families are the face's
# own first (Noto Serif JP), then those of the box's faces as the list
# shows them.
open 01a0d8c4-52b6-7b52-9d72-3e8fa01b2c42
expect sysenv: ready
expect sysenv: fonts 3
wait 800
win システム環境設定
click 278 125
wait 500
click 300 194
wait 300
click 700 516
expect sysenv: fontset open Noto Serif JP faces 1 registered
wait 800
shot pop_body
# ファミリ: pressed, carried down a row and let go there
hold 400 433
wait 300
move 400 445
wait 150
move 400 453
wait 300
shot pop_list
up
expect sysenv: fontset family Noto Sans
wait 500
shot pop_chosen
# a click leaves the list standing; the row above the part, pressed, is chosen
click 400 433
wait 500
shot pop_click
click 400 413
expect sysenv: fontset family Noto Serif JP
wait 500
# the keys: Down and Enter
click 400 433
wait 500
key 51
wait 300
shot pop_key
key 28
expect sysenv: fontset family Noto Sans
wait 500
# Escape, and a press off the list, put it away as it was
click 400 433
wait 500
key 29
wait 300
click 400 433
wait 500
click 100 650
wait 500
shot pop_away
# 個別定義: one face, its list of one
click 500 163
wait 500
shot pop_faces
key 29
wait 300
# closed without a change of the face's settings saved
key 08 01
wait 800
shot pop_end
click 455 440
expect sysenv: fontset closed
absent !OACV!
